  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can interrupt the flow of another creature’s ki.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Block Flow<sup>MIM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat in melee as a swift action, or as a ranged touch attack with a range of 5 feet times your mythic tier as a standard action. You add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the save DC and to the number of rounds the effect lasts.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
